---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-border bg-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary">
          <span class="grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground">TA</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold">TransparentAI</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          AI compliance packets your legal team can review in one afternoon.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          TransparentAI is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice.
          We generate structured documentation for review by qualified counsel.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Product</div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href="/checklist" class="hover:text-primary">Free checklist</a></li>
          <li><a href="/questionnaire" class="hover:text-primary">Questionnaire</a></li>
          <li><a href="/packet" class="hover:text-primary">Sample packet</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclosure" class="hover:text-primary">Sample disclosure page</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Company</div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href="/pricing" class="hover:text-primary">Pricing</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-primary" href="mailto:hello@disclosur.co">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-border pt-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <div>© {year} TransparentAI, Inc. · disclosur.co</div>
      <div>Built for California AI transparency (SB 53, AB 853)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
